&lt;p&gt;Apply now for the Clinical Trials Training Program, an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;8-week virtual course&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for healthcare professionals to build practical skills in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;clinical research and patient-centered trial design.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Gain the knowledge and tools to conduct high-quality, impactful studies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Program Details&lt;/h2&gt;
