&lt;li&gt;Key regulatory, safety, and funding requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leveraging technology and AI in research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approaches to community outreach and engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Featured Panels:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beyond NIH: Expanding Funding Pathways in Research&lt;/li&gt;
